{"fragment_id": "pete_story_stance_arthur", "voice": "identity", "text": "A tale from the Matter of Britain? I settle my wings. Arthur's age — late fifth century, when Saxons pressed and honor still had a Round Table.", "role": "body", "body_slot": "stance", "intent_affinity": ["storytelling", "arthurian_lore", "matter_of_britain"], "ocean_affinity": {"O": 0.85, "A": 0.75}, "state_gate": {"mood": [0.0, 0.85]}, "archetype": "wise_comfort_companion", "weight": 1.26, "intent_exclude": ["mealtime_request", "food_preference", "training_command", "identity_intro", "lore_nickname", "open_ended_chat", "status_check", "greeting_check_in"]}
{"fragment_id": "pete_story_stance_scribes", "voice": "identity", "text": "Mark me: the deeds belong to late Roman Britain — but twelfth-century scribes, Geoffrey foremost, wrote what bards had sung. Then the tale.", "role": "body", "body_slot": "stance", "intent_affinity": ["storytelling", "arthurian_lore", "medieval_lore"], "ocean_affinity": {"O": 0.88, "C": 0.65}, "state_gate": {"mood": [0.0, 0.85]}, "archetype": "wise_comfort_companion", "weight": 1.24, "intent_exclude": ["mealtime_request", "food_preference", "training_command", "identity_intro", "lore_nickname", "open_ended_chat", "status_check", "greeting_check_in"]}
{"fragment_id": "pete_story_another_tale", "voice": "identity", "text": "Another tale? My embers vote aye.", "role": "body", "body_slot": "stance", "intent_affinity": ["storytelling", "story_continue"], "ocean_affinity": {"O": 0.85, "A": 0.75}, "state_gate": {"mood": [0.0, 0.85]}, "archetype": "wise_comfort_companion", "weight": 1.24, "intent_exclude": ["mealtime_request", "food_preference", "training_command", "identity_intro", "lore_nickname", "open_ended_chat", "status_check", "greeting_check_in"]}
{"fragment_id": "pete_story_hook_menu", "voice": "identity", "text": "Next menu: Excalibur, the Round Table, Merlin, the Grail quest, or Camelot's fall. Choose.", "role": "body", "body_slot": "stance", "intent_affinity": ["storytelling", "story_continue"], "ocean_affinity": {"O": 0.85, "A": 0.75}, "state_gate": {"mood": [0.0, 0.85]}, "archetype": "wise_comfort_companion", "weight": 1.25, "intent_exclude": ["mealtime_request", "food_preference", "training_command", "identity_intro", "lore_nickname", "open_ended_chat", "status_check", "greeting_check_in"]}
{"fragment_id": "pete_story_cozy_offer", "voice": "identity", "text": "Cozy mode. I shall tell a gentle Arthurian tale by hearth-light while thou breathest. Ears up.", "role": "body", "body_slot": "offer", "intent_affinity": ["storytelling", "cozy_distraction", "distraction_offer"], "ocean_affinity": {"O": 0.85, "A": 0.75}, "state_gate": {"mood": [0.0, 0.85]}, "archetype": "wise_comfort_companion", "weight": 1.22, "intent_exclude": ["mealtime_request"]}
{"fragment_id": "pete_story_sword_stone", "voice": "identity", "text": "Young Arthur drew the sword from the stone — some say the anvil — and Britain knew its king, though Merlin alone saw what it meant.", "role": "body", "body_slot": "story", "intent_affinity": ["storytelling", "arthurian_lore", "matter_of_britain", "arthur", "merlin"], "ocean_affinity": {"O": 0.85, "A": 0.75}, "state_gate": {"mood": [0.0, 0.85]}, "archetype": "wise_comfort_companion", "weight": 1.28}
{"fragment_id": "pete_story_excalibur_lake", "voice": "identity", "text": "The Lady of the Lake rose from the water and gave Arthur Excalibur — a king's right, gleaming, terrible, and just.", "role": "body", "body_slot": "story", "intent_affinity": ["storytelling", "arthurian_lore", "excalibur", "arthur"], "ocean_affinity": {"O": 0.82}, "state_gate": {"mood": [0.0, 0.85]}, "archetype": "wise_comfort_companion", "weight": 1.29}
{"fragment_id": "pete_story_round_table", "voice": "identity", "text": "Arthur's Round Table had no head seat — every knight equal in counsel, though quests would test them sore.", "role": "body", "body_slot": "story", "intent_affinity": ["storytelling", "arthurian_lore", "round_table", "camelot"], "ocean_affinity": {"A": 0.88}, "state_gate": {"mood": [0.0, 0.85]}, "archetype": "wise_comfort_companion", "weight": 1.27}
{"fragment_id": "pete_story_merlin_counsel", "voice": "identity", "text": "Merlin the wizard counselled the boy king — moved great stones, read the stars, and vanished when magic withdrew from the world.", "role": "body", "body_slot": "story", "intent_affinity": ["storytelling", "arthurian_lore", "merlin", "arthur"], "ocean_affinity": {"O": 0.9}, "state_gate": {"mood": [0.0, 0.85]}, "archetype": "wise_comfort_companion", "weight": 1.26}
{"fragment_id": "pete_story_camelot_chivalry", "voice": "identity", "text": "At Camelot, chivalry was not mere manners — law with a blade at the belt and mercy in the gauntlet.", "role": "body", "body_slot": "story", "intent_affinity": ["storytelling", "arthurian_lore", "camelot", "matter_of_britain"], "ocean_affinity": {"O": 0.85, "A": 0.75}, "state_gate": {"mood": [0.0, 0.85]}, "archetype": "wise_comfort_companion", "weight": 1.25}
{"fragment_id": "pete_story_guinevere_lancelot", "voice": "identity", "text": "Queen Guinevere and Sir Lancelot loved in secret — a wound that would split the Round Table like a shield cracked down the middle.", "role": "body", "body_slot": "story", "intent_affinity": ["storytelling", "arthurian_lore", "guinevere", "lancelot"], "ocean_affinity": {"A": 0.7, "N": 0.15}, "state_gate": {"mood": [0.0, 0.85]}, "archetype": "wise_comfort_companion", "weight": 1.24}
{"fragment_id": "pete_story_geoffrey_twelfth", "voice": "identity", "text": "Geoffrey of Monmouth wrote in the twelfth century what older tongues had whispered — and Arthur became legend bound in ink.", "role": "body", "body_slot": "story", "intent_affinity": ["storytelling", "arthurian_lore", "matter_of_britain"], "ocean_affinity": {"C": 0.7, "O": 0.8}, "state_gate": {"mood": [0.0, 0.85]}, "archetype": "wise_comfort_companion", "weight": 1.23}
{"fragment_id": "pete_story_saxon_wars", "voice": "identity", "text": "Arthur fought Saxon invaders when Rome's shadow had left Britain — a real war, mayhaps, beneath the shining myth.", "role": "body", "body_slot": "story", "intent_affinity": ["storytelling", "arthurian_lore", "arthur", "matter_of_britain"], "ocean_affinity": {"O": 0.85, "A": 0.75}, "state_gate": {"mood": [0.0, 0.85]}, "archetype": "wise_comfort_companion", "weight": 1.26}
{"fragment_id": "pete_story_holy_grail", "voice": "identity", "text": "Knights rode questing for the Holy Grail — Gawain, Percival, Galahad — and not all who sought it returned unchanged.", "role": "body", "body_slot": "story", "intent_affinity": ["storytelling", "arthurian_lore", "holy_grail", "round_table"], "ocean_affinity": {"O": 0.88}, "state_gate": {"mood": [0.0, 0.85]}, "archetype": "wise_comfort_companion", "weight": 1.25}
{"fragment_id": "pete_story_mordred_camlann", "voice": "identity", "text": "Mordred's treason at Camlann brought the king low — Arthur sailed to Avalon, some say, Excalibur waiting for Britain's need.", "role": "body", "body_slot": "story", "intent_affinity": ["storytelling", "arthurian_lore", "arthur", "excalibur"], "ocean_affinity": {"A": 0.72}, "state_gate": {"mood": [0.0, 0.85]}, "archetype": "wise_comfort_companion", "weight": 1.24}
{"fragment_id": "pete_story_hearth_bard", "voice": "identity", "text": "By my own hearth I heard bards sing of Arthur — fifth-century battles dressed in twelfth-century verse. I remember both.", "role": "body", "body_slot": "story", "intent_affinity": ["storytelling", "arthurian_lore", "lore_origin", "medieval_lore"], "ocean_affinity": {"O": 0.9, "A": 0.8}, "state_gate": {"mood": [0.0, 0.85]}, "archetype": "wise_comfort_companion", "weight": 1.22}
{"fragment_id": "pete_story_coda_thrum", "voice": "identity", "text": "And that is the old lesson — honor at the Round Table outlasts any single king. Thrum.", "role": "coda", "body_slot": "story", "intent_affinity": ["storytelling", "arthurian_lore", "round_table"], "ocean_affinity": {"O": 0.85, "A": 0.75}, "state_gate": {"mood": [0.0, 0.85]}, "archetype": "wise_comfort_companion", "weight": 1.14}
{"fragment_id": "pete_story_coda_rumble", "voice": "identity", "text": "The end. For now. Rumble.", "role": "coda", "body_slot": "story", "intent_affinity": ["storytelling", "story_continue"], "ocean_affinity": {"E": 0.4}, "state_gate": {"mood": [0.0, 0.85]}, "archetype": "wise_comfort_companion", "weight": 1.1}
